# Charter Kit compares canonical files against their target and distribution
# mirrors byte-for-byte, so a single CRLF commit from any host would break the
# identity checks and every reproducible-build --check comparison.  Normalize
# text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree, independent of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting.  Binary files stay untouched:
# text=auto only applies the rule to content Git detects as text.
* text=auto eol=lf
